        <activityName xml:lang="en">Hard sandstone, at mine</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Hard sandstone, at mine
Average technology;
UUID: 7214be9d-a07b-393d-a8af-815bdfe16a72
This data set includes the material and energy input to mine 1 m3 of hard sandstone. Mining takes place in Switzerland, Zurich. Additives use (lubrication oil etc) and its transport to the mining site are considered.   Steel and concrete are used to stabilize the mining site.
Location: Data for Switzerland
Technology: none
Time period: undefined
Production volume: 3700 m3
Sampling: unknown 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_7214be9d-a07b-393d-a8af-815bdfe16a72.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
